    "detailed_description": "Cast your dice through the mad Frankenstein's lair! Escape his clutches using your wits and cunning in a variety of stunning locales. Save the day by navigating 3D environments, increasing in complexity and mechanical finesse - offering a unique blend of complex movements, strategic face tearing, and a plethora of intriguing obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complex Movement in a 3D Grid:</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/f511658417183e833d6402bdc0d00106.poster.avif?t=1727702370\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/f511658417183e833d6402bdc0d00106.webm?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/f511658417183e833d6402bdc0d00106.mp4?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate a challenging 3D grid and strategize your moves as you use numbers to climb walls or other dice. Numerous obstacles and unique dice interactions create a complex puzzle adventure that challenges your spatial reasoning and critical thinking skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tearing Off and Replacing Faces:</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/c464397e7cb11327d1d16447a65a8c45.poster.avif?t=1727702370\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/c464397e7cb11327d1d16447a65a8c45.webm?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/c464397e7cb11327d1d16447a65a8c45.mp4?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Utilize the surroundings to strategically rearrange your modular dice, adding a dynamic and interactive element to the challenge. Removing faces creates holes in your dice; rearrange them to allow for new movement options and swap them between different dice to match the challenges that lie ahead.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obstacles &amp; Special Faces:</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/1ebdb92ce049f6de500829b62dd4a864.poster.avif?t=1727702370\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/1ebdb92ce049f6de500829b62dd4a864.webm?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/1ebdb92ce049f6de500829b62dd4a864.mp4?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From imposing gates and menacing spikes to tricky pressure plates and fiery hazards, each level is a unique puzzle waiting to be solved. Whether it's a mouth that can interact with objects, a lamp that lights the way, or a frozen face that allows your dice to slide, these special faces introduce exciting new dimensions to your puzzle-solving journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization and Challenges:</strong></h2>Unlock new skins for your die-frame and earn medals by completing additional challenges, such as turn-trials and hidden collectibles.",
    "about_the_game": "Cast your dice through the mad Frankenstein's lair! Escape his clutches using your wits and cunning in a variety of stunning locales. Save the day by navigating 3D environments, increasing in complexity and mechanical finesse - offering a unique blend of complex movements, strategic face tearing, and a plethora of intriguing obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complex Movement in a 3D Grid:</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/f511658417183e833d6402bdc0d00106.poster.avif?t=1727702370\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/f511658417183e833d6402bdc0d00106.webm?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/f511658417183e833d6402bdc0d00106.mp4?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate a challenging 3D grid and strategize your moves as you use numbers to climb walls or other dice. Numerous obstacles and unique dice interactions create a complex puzzle adventure that challenges your spatial reasoning and critical thinking skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tearing Off and Replacing Faces:</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/c464397e7cb11327d1d16447a65a8c45.poster.avif?t=1727702370\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/c464397e7cb11327d1d16447a65a8c45.webm?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/c464397e7cb11327d1d16447a65a8c45.mp4?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Utilize the surroundings to strategically rearrange your modular dice, adding a dynamic and interactive element to the challenge. Removing faces creates holes in your dice; rearrange them to allow for new movement options and swap them between different dice to match the challenges that lie ahead.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obstacles &amp; Special Faces:</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/1ebdb92ce049f6de500829b62dd4a864.poster.avif?t=1727702370\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/1ebdb92ce049f6de500829b62dd4a864.webm?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796050/extras/1ebdb92ce049f6de500829b62dd4a864.mp4?t=1727702370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From imposing gates and menacing spikes to tricky pressure plates and fiery hazards, each level is a unique puzzle waiting to be solved. Whether it's a mouth that can interact with objects, a lamp that lights the way, or a frozen face that allows your dice to slide, these special faces introduce exciting new dimensions to your puzzle-solving journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization and Challenges:</strong></h2>Unlock new skins for your die-frame and earn medals by completing additional challenges, such as turn-trials and hidden collectibles.",
